# Implementation Plan — Phase 0: AI Infrastructure Setup

Set up the core AI foundation for SkyVault: Anthropic Claude client for structured JSON generation, OpenAI embeddings client for 1536-dim vector embeddings, `pgvector` Django integration, `pdfplumber` for PDF text extraction, and a diagnostic smoke-test command.

