#### [NEW] `ai_features/management/commands/ai_smoke_test.py`

Management command (`python manage.py ai_smoke_test`):
1. Verifies `pgvector` extension is active in PostgreSQL.
2. Checks API key environment configuration.
3. Tests Claude JSON generation (mock / real call if key provided).
4. Tests OpenAI embedding generation (mock / real call if key provided).

